        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of the companies with which we compete or with which we may compete in the future have significantly greater financial resources and expertise in research and development, manufacturing, preclinical testing, conducting clinical trials, obtaining regulatory approvals and marketing approved drugs than we do and may already have established markets for their products.",
