        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The commercial opportunity for our product candidates could reduce or be eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer, more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
